98114.187 BUTTONS
98114.187 CN7-28 / PA0 = UP
98114.187 CN7-30 / PA1 = DOWN
98114.187 CN7-32 / PA4 = LEFT
98114.187 CN7-34 / PB0 = RIGHT
98114.187 CN10-24 / PB1 = PAGE NEXT
98114.187 PC0 = PAGE PREVIOUS
98114.187 PC1 = CONFIRM (release sends SHORT or LONG)
98114.187 PC2 = MODE LEVER (LOW=capture, HIGH=reading)
